# T32 - failed thesis converted to F may be repeated
PROGRAM 8 0 4.00 12 0
COURSE C1 REGULAR 4 CORE -
COURSE TH THESIS 4 CORE -
STUDENT R1 Asha
REGISTER R1 C1 1
GRADE R1 C1 1 F
GRAD R1
REGISTER R1 C1 2
GRADE R1 C1 2 D
REGISTER R1 TH 3
GRADE R1 TH 3 S
CONVERT R1 TH F
GPA R1
GRAD R1
ELIGIBLE R1 TH 4
REGISTER R1 TH 4
GRADE R1 TH 4 S
CONVERT R1 TH B
GPA R1
GRAD R1
